   "lines": [
    "Every Sunday",
    "we have morning and",
    "evening prayers; I wish",
    "we could have them",
    "every day.",
    "Motherling is just",
    "too sweet and pretty",
    "for anything; and",
    "I doubt if there",
    "ever were two more",
    "^lovely^ ~~noble~~ and unselfish",
    "girls than dear,",
    "noble Bysie, and",
    "darling little",
    "Pussie. These three, and",
    "my best friend, old brother",
    "Nelly give me as happy",
    "a home as a man could",
    "possibly have."
   ],
   "rows": null,
   "columns": null,
   "confidence": "high",
   "note": "'lovely' written in left margin over/beside struck 'noble'"
